WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.468
The Ukrainian city of

00:00:01.468 --> 00:00:02.802
Dnipro is reeling

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.537
from a deadly Russian strike

00:00:04.537 --> 00:00:06.139
on a medical complex

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:07.140
which killed two people

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.708
and injured dozens.

00:00:08.708 --> 00:00:09.442
CNN Senior

00:00:09.442 --> 00:00:11.177
International correspondent Fred Pleitgen

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.113
is in key for us right now Fred.

00:00:13.113 --> 00:00:14.914
Ukraine says this was a deliberate

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:16.883
Russian attack once again

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.251
on Ukrainian civilians.

00:00:18.251 --> 00:00:18.651
What more

00:00:18.651 --> 00:00:19.953
are you learning about this

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:21.388
latest strike?

00:00:22.956 --> 00:00:23.456
Hi there, Wolf.

00:00:23.456 --> 00:00:23.957
What are they saying?

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:24.391
It's it's

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:25.158
a deliberate attack

00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:25.792
using missiles

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:26.526
that are normally used

00:00:26.526 --> 00:00:27.827
to shoot down aircraft.

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:28.928
They're called the S-300

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:30.797
or S-400 missiles.

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:32.499
And if you use those in a ground

00:00:32.499 --> 00:00:33.867
to ground configuration,

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:34.601
the Ukrainians say

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.336
they're extremely inaccurate

00:00:36.336 --> 00:00:38.104
and they can cause massive carnage

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:39.773
if they're shot at urban areas.

00:00:39.773 --> 00:00:41.141
It's exactly what happened today

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:42.375
in the town of Dnipro.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.076
Here's what we're learning

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.514
The horrifying aftermath of

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:49.382
another Russian airstrike,

00:00:49.382 --> 00:00:50.383
a medical facility

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.985
hit in Dnipro, killing

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:54.187
two and wounding scores

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:54.788
as Moscow

00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:56.523
launched another round of drone

00:00:56.523 --> 00:00:57.524
and missile strikes

00:00:57.524 --> 00:01:00.994
at targets across Ukraine.

00:01:01.428 --> 00:01:02.262
But Kiev says

00:01:02.262 --> 00:01:03.029
this time

00:01:03.029 --> 00:01:04.264
they managed to take down

00:01:04.264 --> 00:01:05.665
all the cruise missiles

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:06.132
and nearly

00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:08.935
all the Iranian supplied charred drones.

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:12.605
CNN got rare access to a key

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:15.675
component of Ukraine's air defense.

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:18.244
The German made Gephardt anti-aircraft

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:20.480
system known as the shithead killer

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.550
site that much of time is essential.

00:01:23.550 --> 00:01:25.151
Radar operator Olé tells me

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:26.753
there may be three to four targets

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:28.888
and we need to destroy them one by one.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:30.090
The computer system

00:01:30.090 --> 00:01:31.791
makes it as easy as possible

00:01:31.791 --> 00:01:34.360
for the gunner to succeed

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.230
Ukrainian forces gave us this video

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:38.231
they say shows

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:39.299
a gap are destroying

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.401
several Iranian made drones

00:01:41.401 --> 00:01:43.169
and this one even shooting down

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:45.171
a cruise missile late last year.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:47.073
Yes, gunfire.

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:48.274
It's part of Ukraine's

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:49.809
increasingly effective,

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:50.677
mostly Western

00:01:50.677 --> 00:01:52.378
supplied, layered, short,

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:54.481
medium and long range air defense

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:56.583
including the US made patriots

00:01:56.583 --> 00:01:57.450
that both Washington

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:58.952
and Kiev say have managed

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:00.587
to even take down the feared

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:01.421
Russian tinge.

00:02:01.421 --> 00:02:03.123
While hypersonic missiles

00:02:03.123 --> 00:02:04.557
that can travel ten times

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:05.758
the speed of sound

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:07.794
and which Putin claimed were invincible.

00:02:09.329 --> 00:02:09.929
The commander of

00:02:09.929 --> 00:02:12.398
Ukraine's joint forces tells me system

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:13.533
supplied by the U.S.

00:02:13.533 --> 00:02:14.334
and its allies

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:15.735
are making all the difference,

00:02:15.735 --> 00:02:17.003
as the Kremlin does.

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:18.605
We have the means that can fight tin

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:19.572
gels and ballistic

00:02:19.572 --> 00:02:20.907
missiles, as well as cruise

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:22.942
missiles and strike drones, he tells me.

00:02:22.942 --> 00:02:23.843
And the percentage

00:02:23.843 --> 00:02:25.411
is constantly increasing.

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:27.780
Now, the efficiency is over 80%

00:02:28.047 --> 00:02:30.216
from this episode perfectly.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:31.751
And as Ukraine's army

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.319
gears up for a large scale

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.454
counteroffensive,

00:02:34.454 --> 00:02:35.588
a strong protection

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:37.023
against threats from the skies

00:02:37.023 --> 00:02:38.424
will be crucial.

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:39.192
The Ukrainian say

00:02:39.192 --> 00:02:40.593
they fully understand that

00:02:40.593 --> 00:02:41.294
effective air

00:02:41.294 --> 00:02:42.529
defense will be critical

00:02:42.529 --> 00:02:44.297
to their upcoming counter offensive

00:02:44.297 --> 00:02:45.498
not just to protect

00:02:45.498 --> 00:02:47.834
critical infrastructure and ammunition,

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:50.069
but to defend advancing forces as well.

00:02:50.937 --> 00:02:52.639
What kind of sea

00:02:52.639 --> 00:02:55.074
the enemy will throw all available forces

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:56.309
to reduce the combat

00:02:56.309 --> 00:02:57.710
potential of our offensive,

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:58.878
the general tells me.

00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:00.480
The success during the advance

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.181
and liberation

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:02.615
of Ukrainian territory

00:03:02.615 --> 00:03:04.517
will depend on high quality air

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:05.218
defense

00:03:05.218 --> 00:03:06.953
and civilian lives on the ground

00:03:06.953 --> 00:03:08.354
depend on it as well

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:10.390
to prevent attacks like in Dnipro,

00:03:10.423 --> 00:03:12.725
where once again so many were harmed

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:15.862
So more

00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:16.896
news happening tonight,

00:03:16.896 --> 00:03:18.331
Wolf, from the Russian occupied

00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:19.365
city of Mariupol.

00:03:19.365 --> 00:03:20.466
Apparently some explosions

00:03:20.466 --> 00:03:22.168
going on there.

00:03:22.168 --> 00:03:23.303
The authorities there

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:24.637
the Russian installed authorities

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:25.772
there are saying they believe

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:27.307
that it was Ukrainian long

00:03:27.307 --> 00:03:29.108
distance rockets hitting targets there.

00:03:29.108 --> 00:03:30.510
Of course,
we know Mariupol

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:30.877
right now,

00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:31.411
one of the main

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:33.179
staging points for the Russians

00:03:33.179 --> 00:03:35.181
for their war in Ukraine.

00:03:35.181 --> 00:03:36.182
And of course, we also know

00:03:36.182 --> 00:03:36.883
that some believe

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:38.151
that shaping operations

00:03:38.151 --> 00:03:39.519
for that Ukrainian offensive

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:41.521
might already be going on Wolf.

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:43.489
Fred Pleitgen reporting from Ukraine.

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:45.625
Stay safe. Fred, thank you very much.

00:03:45.658 --> 00:03:47.594
Joining us now to break down these late

00:03:47.594 --> 00:03:48.795
breaking developments out there

00:03:48.795 --> 00:03:50.296
on the front lines of Ukraine,

00:03:50.296 --> 00:03:52.365
CNN military analyst, retired U.S.

00:03:52.532 --> 00:03:53.032
Air Force

00:03:53.032 --> 00:03:53.700
Colonel Cedric

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:55.301
