00:03:58.071 --> 00:03:59.038
Colonel Leighton,

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:00.540
Russia has a proven record

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.642
of attacking medical targets,

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:04.844
but is this strike also a reaction

00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:06.713
to Ukraine's expected

00:04:06.713 --> 00:04:08.514
counteroffensive that's about to begin

00:04:10.550 --> 00:04:12.252
It could very well be, Wolf.

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:13.987
And the reason I say that is

00:04:13.987 --> 00:04:15.388
they were clearly lobbing

00:04:15.388 --> 00:04:16.856
artillery tours to areas

00:04:16.856 --> 00:04:18.258
where they think the Ukrainians

00:04:18.258 --> 00:04:20.827
are staging their military at.

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:23.363
And Dnipro would be the perfect place

00:04:23.563 --> 00:04:25.265
