00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:26.933
and then move into the south,

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:27.700
particularly to go

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:28.801
after the land bridge

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:30.470
that the Russians have set up

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:32.972
between Crimea and the Donbas.

00:04:32.972 --> 00:04:33.940
Ambassador Taylor,

00:04:33.940 --> 00:04:35.608
I know you just returned from a meeting

00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:37.477
