00:04:39.012 --> 00:04:40.146
What are you hearing from them

00:04:40.146 --> 00:04:41.414
about their readiness

00:04:41.414 --> 00:04:42.782
for this offensive,

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:44.717
this counteroffensive?

00:04:45.485 --> 00:04:46.919
Wolf, they are ready.

00:04:46.919 --> 00:04:49.155
We talked to the minister of defense

00:04:49.155 --> 00:04:50.023
as well as the minister

00:04:50.023 --> 00:04:52.091
of foreign affairs, as well as soldiers,

00:04:52.292 --> 00:04:53.159
both privates

00:04:53.159 --> 00:04:55.495
that are going back out to the front.

00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:57.063
Lieutenant, what is General?

00:04:57.063 --> 00:04:58.364
They are ready.

00:04:58.364 --> 00:05:00.233
They are as you just reported,

00:05:00.233 --> 00:05:02.001
they are so pleased that the weapons

00:05:02.001 --> 00:05:03.002
that they've gotten,

00:05:03.002 --> 00:05:03.770
their ability

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:04.904
to shoot down these missiles,

00:05:04.904 --> 00:05:07.006
but also all the armor

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.008
that they've gotten in order to

00:05:09.008 --> 00:05:11.678
