00:05:12.578 --> 00:05:13.413
Colonel Leighton,

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:14.247
you just heard and Fred

00:05:14.247 --> 00:05:15.948
Pleitgen is report from Kiev

00:05:15.948 --> 00:05:17.317
about the success

00:05:17.317 --> 00:05:18.017
that Ukraine's

00:05:18.017 --> 00:05:18.818
air defenses

00:05:18.818 --> 00:05:20.553
