offensive capability in the air

00:05:37.136 --> 00:05:39.005
Well, it's it's certainly

00:05:39.005 --> 00:05:41.040
without the F-16, of course, it's

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:43.076
weaker than it would otherwise be.

00:05:43.076 --> 00:05:44.711
But the Ukrainians weren't

00:05:44.711 --> 00:05:46.913
going to be getting the F-16 before

00:05:46.913 --> 00:05:47.714
this offensive

00:05:47.714 --> 00:05:49.682
or even during this offensive.

00:05:49.682 --> 00:05:50.350
Their offensive

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:52.385
capabilities are fairly strong

00:05:52.385 --> 00:05:54.253
and they have the ability to move

00:05:54.253 --> 00:05:55.088
with their tanks.

00:05:55.088 --> 00:05:56.289
They have their ability to move

00:05:56.289 --> 00:05:57.924
